{
  "id": "338",
  "title": "How Many People are Eating?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-07-01",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming doesn't want to let the waitress know how much he eats.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/458/6eb798b3bc67c34ea20fe98477cfb4f76ae5e386.mp3?1496729529",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "几个人吃？\n\n    小明肚子饿了，他去饭店点菜，准备带回家吃。\n    服务员问他：“几个人吃？”\n    他想：要是我说是一个人吃的话，服务员肯定会笑我吃太多，说我是小胖子的。所以他回答说：“是两个人。”\n    服务员说：“两个人吃这么多啊！”",
    "traditional": "幾個人吃？\n\n    小明肚子餓了，他去飯店點菜，準備帶回家吃。\n    服務員問他：“幾個人吃？”\n    他想：要是我說是一個人吃的話，服務員肯定會笑我吃太多，說我是小胖子的。所以他回答說：“是兩個人。”\n    服務員說：“兩個人吃這麼多啊！”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How many people are eating?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明肚子饿了，他去饭店点菜，准备带回家吃。",
      "traditional": "小明肚子餓了，他去飯店點菜，準備帶回家吃。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng dù zi è le tā qù fàn diàn diǎn cài zhǔn bèi dài huí jiā chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming was hungry. He went to the restaurant to order, and was just about to return home to eat."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "服务员问他：“几个人吃？”",
      "traditional": "服務員問他：“幾個人吃？”",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán wèn tā jǐ ge rén chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The waitress asked him: “How many people are eating?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "他想：要是我说是一个人吃的话，服务员肯定会笑我吃太多，说我是小胖子的。",
      "traditional": "他想：要是我說是一個人吃的話，服務員肯定會笑我吃太多，說我是小胖子的。",
      "pinyin": "tā xiǎng yào shi wǒ shuō shì yí ge rén chī de huà fú wù yuán kěn dìng huì xiào wǒ chī tài duō shuō wǒ shì xiǎo pàng zi de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "所以他回答说：“是两个人。”",
      "traditional": "所以他回答說：“是兩個人。”",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ tā huí dá shuō shì liǎng ge rén",
      "english": "He thought: If I tell her it's one person, she will surely laugh at me for eating too much and call me a little fatty."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "So he replied: “Two people.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "服务员说：“两个人吃这么多啊！”",
      "traditional": "服務員說：“兩個人吃這麼多啊！”",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán shuō liǎng ge rén chī zhè me duō a",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
