    "sentence_translations": [
      "How many people are eating?",
      "",
      "Little Ming was hungry. He went to the restaurant to order, and was just about to return home to eat.",
      "",
      "The waitress asked him: “How many people are eating?”",
      "",
      "He thought: If I tell her it's one person, she will surely laugh at me for eating too much and call me a little fatty.",
      "So he replied: “Two people.”",
      "",
      "The waitress said: “Are just two people going to eat that much!”"
